  "buffers()": "..."
  tooltip: "```text\nGenerationFiles.buffers:\nReturn a complete new snapshot of all ordinary file text documents currently open in the editor, including hidden buffers, with actual URI/version/text/dirty facts. Closed documents are absent. No source parsing, output inference or cached permission result.\n```"
}
